      "id": "claim_add81add40654c95bb3dc94c9ad800e6",
      "statement": "Kissaten is a three-layer system: a SvelteKit 5 frontend (runes mode) under frontend/, a FastAPI backend under src/kissaten/api/ that serves a DuckDB data layer, and a scraping/AI pipeline under src/kissaten/scrapers and src/kissaten/ai that populates it; the frontend reaches catalog data only through the FastAPI API, while user-scoped data uses a separate local-first sync path.",
