      "statement": "db.py opens one module-level DuckDB connection whose mode is selected by KISSATEN_USE_RW_DB: read-write with permissive config for CLI refresh and tests (runs migrations), and read-only for the API server (loads the FTS extension then sets enable_external_access=false, runs no migrations).",
