      "statement": "A production-DB safety guard refuses to open kissaten.duckdb or rw_kissaten.duckdb with a writable connection config unless KISSATEN_ALLOW_PRODUCTION_DB=1; the API config satisfies the guard because enable_external_access=False counts as non-writable, so the guard is an opt-in mechanism for tests and ad-hoc scripts.",
